{"task_id": "Mbpp/235", "solution": "def even_bit_set_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Sets all even-position bits of a given integer n to 1.\n    Bit positions are counted starting at 1 from the least significant bit (LSB).\n    \"\"\"\n    bit_length = max(1, n.bit_length())\n    mask = 0\n    for pos in range(2, bit_length + 1, 2):\n        mask |= (1 << (pos - 1))\n    return n | mask"}
